[center][size=5][b]OPEN SOURCE[/b][/size][/center]

ERNativeUI is my first Elden Ring mod and is released under the MIT License. Contributions, forks, compatibility improvements, documentation and carefully validated native-interface research are welcome while respecting the included licenses and copyright notices.

[b]Contributor credit:[/b] [url=https://github.com/AnThanhLe][b]An Thanh Le[/b][/url] - contributed the Vietnamese translation.

ERNativeUI was developed with AI assistance, including assistance with promotional media and documentation. The implementation has been repeatedly validated in game throughout development.

